---
import Icon from "./Icon.astro";
import Logo from "./Logo.astro";
import { base } from "../lib/base-url.mjs";
import { site, REPO_URL } from "../lib/site.mjs";
---

<footer class="foot">
  <div class="wrap grid">
    <div class="about">
      <div class="brand">
        <Logo size={36} />
        <span class="display">좀보이드 멀티</span>
      </div>
      <p>
        지인끼리 쓰는 비공식 안내 페이지입니다. Project Zomboid는 The Indie Stone의 게임이며,
        각 모드의 저작권은 제작자에게 있습니다.
      </p>
      <!-- 게임 아이콘·그림을 쓰므로 The Indie Stone 약관 2.2항이 정한 문구를 그대로 붙인다. -->
      <p class="tis" lang="en">
        Thanks to The Indie Stone for creating Project Zomboid (<a href="https://projectzomboid.com/" rel="noopener">https://projectzomboid.com/</a>),
        which made this possible. This is an unofficial fan production for non-commercial purposes made under the
        <a href="https://projectzomboid.com/blog/support/terms-conditions/" rel="noopener">Indie Stone Terms</a>.
      </p>
    </div>

    <nav class="links" aria-label="바닥 메뉴">
      <a href={base("guide/#host-0")}><Icon name="server-stack-01" size={16} />호스트 가이드</a>
      <a href={base("guide/#join-0")}><Icon name="user-group" size={16} />참가자 가이드</a>
      <a href={base("character/")}><Icon name="user-circle" size={16} />캐릭터 만들기</a>
      <a href={base("tips/")}><Icon name="bulb" size={16} />플레이 팁</a>
      <a href={base("mods/")}><Icon name="package" size={16} />모드 목록</a>
      <a href={base("help/")}><Icon name="first-aid-kit" size={16} />문제 해결</a>
      <a href={REPO_URL} rel="noopener"><Icon name="github" size={16} />저장소</a>
    </nav>

    <dl class="facts">
      <div><dt>게임 버전</dt><dd class="mono">Build {site.build}</dd></div>
      <div><dt>모드팩</dt><dd class="mono">{site.modpackVersion} · {site.modCount}개</dd></div>
      <div><dt>마지막 확인</dt><dd class="mono">{site.checkedAt}</dd></div>
    </dl>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .foot {
    margin-top: 120px;
    border-top: 3px solid var(--red);
    background: var(--night);
    color: var(--night-dim);
    --logo-gap: var(--night);
  }
  .grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 40px;
    padding-block: 56px 64px;
  }
  .brand {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
    color: var(--night-ink);
    font-size: 22px;
  }
  .about p {
    max-width: 44ch;
    font-size: 14px;
  }
  .about .tis {
    margin-top: 12px;
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }
  .tis a {
    color: var(--night-ink);
  }
  .links {
    display: grid;
    gap: 6px;
    align-content: start;
  }
  .links a {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    width: fit-content;
    padding: 4px 0;
    color: var(--night-ink);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 15px;
  }
  .links a:hover {
    color: var(--sodium);
  }
  .facts {
    display: grid;
    gap: 12px;
    margin: 0;
    align-content: start;
  }
  .facts div {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 16px;
    padding-bottom: 10px;
    border-bottom: 1px dashed #3a3a2e;
  }
  .facts dt {
    font-size: 13px;
  }
  .facts dd {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--night-ink);
    font-size: 13px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 32px;
    }
  }
</style>
